Package: mt7663-router-webui
Version: 1.0.5
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: mt7663-dkms, hostapd, dnsmasq, python3, network-manager, iptables, wireless-tools, iw
Maintainer: Van der Decken <elsangithub@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Turnkey SoftAP Hotspot & WSGI Router Management Web UI
 Lightweight, zero-dependency WSGI management dashboard and SoftAP
 hotspot controller for MediaTek MT7663 on FiberHome HG680-FJ.
 Provides dual-band simultaneous Wi-Fi Repeater mode (DBDC),
 dynamic bandwidth control, and live device telemetry.
